        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-14T15:27:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I sleeve my hero cards and variant cards to keep them nice and shiny (especially&nbsp;with the foil cards). I also keep all my variants alongside the hero deck they belong to, rather than in a \"variant\" section in the back, and having them sleeved allows me to quickly visually separate those cards from the unsleeved&nbsp;hero deck.</p>\n<p>I don't sleeve the rest of the cards as I'm with MigrantP and shuffling sleeved cards just doesn't feel right. But then, I've played poker for decades, I'm very comfortable with riffle shuffling cards and mash shuffling seems wrong.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
