        "created_at": "2019-01-24T16:29:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I haven't sleeved my cards yet. I'm still looking for an option that I won't have to repeatedly replace, but can still see the card backs. But I have sleeved most of my deck building games and for those I use BCW Deck Guards.</p>",
